    gamma=  1.0 H0, 100 Hz: (v_ph-c)/c = -g^2/8w^2 = -1.53e-42; (v_g-c)/c = +1.53e-42 (analytic; below double precision numerically); front velocity = c
    gamma=  3.0 H0, 100 Hz: (v_ph-c)/c = -g^2/8w^2 = -1.38e-41; (v_g-c)/c = +1.38e-41 (analytic; below double precision numerically); front velocity = c
    gamma= 60.0 H0, 100 Hz: (v_ph-c)/c = -g^2/8w^2 = -5.52e-39; (v_g-c)/c = +5.52e-39 (analytic; below double precision numerically); front velocity = c
